00:24:10.433 --> 00:24:12.197
And you do that with
a variety of tools.

00:24:12.197 --> 00:24:13.280
You do it with anti-virus.

00:24:13.280 --> 00:24:14.321
You've got audit logging.

00:24:14.321 --> 00:24:15.920
You've got intrusion
detection, maybe

00:24:15.920 --> 00:24:17.545
