00:36:48.990 --> 00:36:51.469
or off the customer premise
back into the shielded VM

00:36:51.469 --> 00:36:53.260
to be a rooted trust
or to be an encryption

00:36:53.260 --> 00:36:56.920
key for the database that's
running in the key management.

00:36:56.920 --> 00:37:01.510
We're excited about potentially
getting custom images being

00:37:01.510 --> 00:37:03.640
